{
  "html": [
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "h2",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Use x402 for machine-to-machine payments."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "x402 is a protocol for internet payments. When a client requests a paid resource, your server returns a "
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "block": false,
          "language": "",
          "text": "402 Payment Required"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " response with payment details. The client completes the payment and retries the request with proof of payment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "h2",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Before you begin"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "ul",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "A Stripe account."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Crypto payins enabled for your account."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Machine-to-machine payments for x402 enabled."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "h2",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Create your endpoint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Add payment middleware to your endpoint so it can accept x402 payments. The middleware handles payment verification and settlement with Stripe per request to "
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "block": false,
          "language": "",
          "text": "/paid"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "block": true,
      "language": "",
      "text": "import { paymentMiddleware } from \"@x402/hono\";\nimport { x402ResourceServer, HTTPFacilitatorClient } from \"@x402/core/server\";\n\napp.use(\n  paymentMiddleware(\n    {\n      \"GET /paid\": {\n        price: \"$0.001\",\n        network: \"base-sepolia\",\n        config: { description: \"Access to paid content\" }\n      }\n    },\n    facilitatorClient,\n    resourceServer\n  )\n);"
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "h2",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Test your endpoint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Make a request to your server without an existing payment header, and you receive a "
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "block": false,
          "language": "",
          "text": "402"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " response with payment requirements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "block": true,
      "language": "",
      "text": "curl http://localhost:3000/paid"
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "h2",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Run mainnet transactions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "To run mainnet transactions, integrate with the mainnet facilitator and configure your environment for production use."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
